#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:5
msgid "HTML Mockup Generation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:7
msgid ""
"Guidelines for generating self-contained HTML mockups that look "
"professional and are easy to iterate on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:9
msgid "Return contract (read first)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:11
msgid ""
"When this skill runs inside a subagent (the usual case via `ui-designer` "
"or `/mock`), the subagent's narrative return text is **not shown directly"
" to the user** — the orchestrator surfaces a parseable file list. The "
"last thing the subagent emits MUST be a `<MOCKUP_FILES>` block listing "
"every file written:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:13
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<MOCKUP_FILES>\n"
".hero/mocks/{slug}/index.html|{Mockup name}|primary\n"
".hero/planning/features/{slug}/spec.md|Spec (Mockups section "
"updated)|spec\n"
"</MOCKUP_FILES>\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:20
msgid ""
"One file per line, pipe-separated `path|label|kind`. Include every "
"variant when generating multiple options in one run. Skip this block and "
"the user sees no links. See the `ui-designer` agent definition for full "
"rules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:22
msgid "When to use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:24
msgid ""
"Selection is now driven by `hero spec mock detect` (see `hero spec mock "
"detect --help`). The agent does not decide — the CLI does. This skill is "
"loaded whenever the detect output's `renderer` field is `\"html\"`, which"
" fires when no Swift signals are detected, when `--renderer=html` was "
"explicit, when `hero.json` `mockups.renderer: \"html\"` overrides auto-"
"detect, or as a fallback when Swift signals are present but `swiftc` is "
"missing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:26
msgid "File Structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/skills/html-mockup-generation/SKILL.md:28
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"<!DOCTYPE html>\n"
"<!-- Hero Mock: {slug} | Generated: {date} -->\n"
"<!-- Description: {one-line description} -->\n"
"<html lang=\"en\">\n"
"<head>\n"
"    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n"
"    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-"
"scale=1.0\">\n"
"    <title>{Title} — Mock</title>\n"
"    <style>\n"
"        /* All CSS here — no external stylesheets */\n"
"    </style>\n"
"</head>\n"
"<body>\n"
"    <!-- All markup here -->\n"
"    <script>\n"
"        /* All JS here — no external scripts */\n"
"    </script>\n"
"</body>\n"
"</html>\n"
msgstr ""

